1
00:06:23,333 --> 00:06:29,333
The Bellas were one big happy family. Then Renata met Sam...

2
00:12:46,666 --> 00:12:52,666
Once Around is a comedy, drama, romance film directed by Lasse Hallström.

3
00:19:10,000 --> 00:19:16,000
Renata Bella feels like a failure at life and career.

4
00:25:33,333 --> 00:25:39,333
But when Renata attends a seminar on selling real
estate, she finally finds True Love.

5
00:31:56,666 --> 00:32:02,666
Sam Sharpe, while a top-notch, successful salesman, is much older than Renata.

6
00:38:20,000 --> 00:38:26,000
She is swept away by his excessively flamboyant style and irrepressible nature.

7
00:44:43,333 --> 00:44:49,333
The very traits she finds romantic, however, lead to repeated conflict with her family,
especially her beloved father Joe, leaving Renata trapped in the middle.

8
00:51:06,666 --> 00:51:12,666
Sam Sharpe, played by Richard Dreyfuss.

9
00:57:30,000 --> 00:57:36,000
Renata Bella, played by Holly Hunter.

10
01:03:53,333 --> 01:03:59,333
Joe Bella, played by Danny Aiello.

11
01:10:16,666 --> 01:10:22,666
Jan Bella, played by Laura San Giacomo.

12
01:16:40,000 --> 01:16:46,000
Marilyn Bella, played by Gena Rowlands.

13
01:23:03,333 --> 01:23:09,333
Gail Bella, played by Roxanne Hart.

14
01:29:26,666 --> 01:29:32,666
Once Around is a 1991 American romantic comedy-drama film about a young woman who falls for and eventually marries an overbearing older man
who proceeds to rub her close-knit family the wrong way, while exposing the dynamics of other family members along the way.

15
01:35:50,000 --> 01:35:56,000
It stars Richard Dreyfuss, Holly Hunter, Danny Aiello, Laura San Giacomo and Gena Rowlands and was written by Malia
Scotch Marmo and directed by Swedish director Lasse Hallström, in his full English-language film debut.

16
01:42:13,333 --> 01:42:19,333
The film explores themes of italian american, boston, massachusetts, romcom.

17
01:48:36,666 --> 01:48:42,666
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
